      239.83,
      387.11,
      359.84,
      395.97
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      406.39,
      455.91,
      435.26
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 75 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended is toincrease the age limit under which no act of a child is an offence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      445.99,
      455.87,
      484.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 76 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to raise the age segment within which no act of a child is anoffence, if the judge is of the opinion that he has not attained sufficient maturity to understandthe nature and consequences of his act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
