    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PENAL CODE (CHAPTER 19)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      251.45,
      401.9,
      274.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      287.45,
      401.87,
      310.79
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Penal Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      323.45,
      401.91,
      358.79
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 75 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amendedby the substitution\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      371.45,
      401.92,
      394.79
    ],
    "text": "(1)for the words \u201ceight years\u201d of the words \u201ctwelveyears\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      407.45,
      401.89,
      430.79
    ],
    "text": "(2)in the marginal note thereof, for the words \u201ceightyears\u201d, of the words \u201ctwelve years\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      443.45,
      401.88,
      466.79
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 76 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      479.45,
      401.87,
      514.79
    ],
    "text": "(1)for the words \u201cabove eight years of age and undertwelve,\u201d of the words \u201cabove twelve years of ageand under fourteen\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      527.45,
      401.87,
      562.79
    ],
    "text": "(2)in the marginal note thereof, for the words \u201caboveeight and under twelve\u201d of the words \u201cabove twelveand under fourteen\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      575.45,
      401.9,
      598.79
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
